---
import ShieldMark from './ShieldMark.astro';
---
<section>
  <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;gap:40px;align-items:center;" data-cols>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Boots on the ground</span>
      <h2>Software watches.<br /><span class="accent">Pros show up.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:22px;">
        Preventive maintenance is not a notification — it is a person with tools
        in their hands. Every plan includes prepaid professional hours: an
        experienced mechanic handles the service your fleet actually needs,
        before it becomes a tow bill.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-top:22px;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--muted);">
        <li>✓ Experienced, vetted maintenance professionals</li>
        <li>✓ Hours pool across your whole fleet</li>
        <li>✓ Scheduled around your routes — not the other way around</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="card" style="display:inline-block;padding:48px;">
        <ShieldMark width="120" height="120" />
        <p style="margin-top:18px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;">
          One invoice. Zero breakdowns.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (min-width: 860px) { section[data-cols] { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; } }
</style>
